@startuml
!theme plain

skinparam component {
  FontSize 13
  FontName "Microsoft YaHei"
}

skinparam rectangle {
  FontSize 12
  FontName "Microsoft YaHei"
}

title 后端模块架构图 — Maven 多模块单体

rectangle "filmdrop-web\n启动入口 + REST 控制器\n+ Security 配置" as web #FFCDD2

rectangle "filmdrop-user\n用户模块" as user #C8E6C9
rectangle "filmdrop-movie\n电影模块" as movie #C8E6C9
rectangle "filmdrop-crawler\n爬虫模块" as crawler #C8E6C9

rectangle "filmdrop-recommendation\n推荐模块" as recommendation #BBDEFB

rectangle "filmdrop-push\n推送模块\n(XXL-Job Executor)" as push #FFE0B2

rectangle "filmdrop-common\n共享工具、常量、异常" as common #F5F5F5

' === 模块间依赖 ===
web --> user
web --> movie
web --> recommendation
web --> crawler
web --> push

recommendation --> movie
recommendation --> user

push --> user

user --> common
movie --> common
recommendation --> common
crawler --> common
push --> common

note top of web
  Spring Boot 主启动类
  Security 配置 (JWT 鉴权)
  全局异常处理
  公开 API / 登录 API 路由
end note

note right of user
  - 用户注册/登录
  - JWT Token 颁发
  - 偏好管理
  - 设置管理
end note

note right of movie
  - 电影 CRUD
  - TMDB 数据同步
  - 搜索与筛选
  - 分类/标签
end note

note right of crawler
  - 豆瓣评分爬取
  - 豆瓣评论爬取
  - 数据合并逻辑
end note

note right of recommendation
  - 推荐匹配算法
  - 推荐记录管理
  - 首页推荐流
end note

note right of push
  - 邮件发送
  - 新片上线推送
  - 定时推送任务
  - XXL-Job 任务定义
end note

note right of common
  - 统一响应体 (Result<T>)
  - 业务异常类
  - 常量定义
  - 工具类
end note

@enduml
